      "label": "Concept: 'Die in Blue'",
      "description": "A phrase used to honor law enforcement officers who die while serving in the line of duty. The term 'blue' refers to the color of police uniforms, symbolizing their service and sacrifice. This concept is widely recognized in policing communities and public discourse as a tribute to fallen officers.",
